  "description": "Motocross-style Bike for Kids - The JOYSTAR Kids' Bike comes with a noise maker, a water bottle, an Number Plate, and fenders. They turn each ride into a wonderful journey, making it highly appealing to young kids at first sight\n\nEnjoy a safer ride! This bike has a rear coaster/foot brake for good stopping power. Wide 2.125\" pneumatic tires add stability. It also includes a strong steel frame, an enclosed chainguard, and reflectors on the front, rear, and wheels\n\nPerfect Bike for Beginners - Training wheels are included for beginners who are still learning to ride. A motocross saddle seat that adds some extra style to this riding machine. With only one speed, there are no complicated gears.\n\nEasy to Assemble - Get riding quickly! The children's bike arrives 85% pre-assembled with basic assembly tools included. A novice can typically complete assembly in about 20 minutes. Plus, it's backed by our limited lifetime warranty\n\nBest Gift for Kids - This Motobike style kids' bike is the perfect gift for children. It's a fantastic way for any young rider who wants that Motocross feel\n\nPerfect Gift for Kids -\n\n12 inch bike is suitable for kids 2-4 years old;\n16 inch bike is suitable for kids 4-7 years (41-53 inch);\nIt's a fantastic way for kids to engage in physical activity, enhance their coordination, boost their confidence, and enjoy endless fun and adventure",
